    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12334081/comment/12382767",
          "id": "12382767",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=olegk",
            "name": "olegk",
            "key": "olegk",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Oleg Kalnichevski",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "Folks, \n\nWe have a release blocker and the most serious bug in HttpClient 3.0 to date\n\nOleg",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=olegk",
            "name": "olegk",
            "key": "olegk",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Oleg Kalnichevski",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "created": "2005-11-03T22:23:28.000+0000",
          "updated": "2005-11-03T22:23:28.000+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12334081/comment/12382768",
          "id": "12382768",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=olegk",
            "name": "olegk",
            "key": "olegk",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Oleg Kalnichevski",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "All right. Things are not as bad as they seemed initially. \n\n(1) The proxy credentials are leaked to the origin server via a secure tunnel\nONLY if the preemptive authentication is being used. The preemptive\nauthentication by itself is a hack and a security risk and should be avoided at\nall costs.\n\n(2) This bug does not affect any of the official releases thanks to the HTTPCLIENT-514\n\nThere is no reason to block the release.\n\nA fix coming shortly.\n\nOleg",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=olegk",
            "name": "olegk",
            "key": "olegk",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Oleg Kalnichevski",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "created": "2005-11-04T04:59:47.000+0000",
          "updated": "2005-11-04T04:59:47.000+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12334081/comment/12382769",
          "id": "12382769",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=asf%40spamblock.netzgehirn.de",
            "name": "asf@spamblock.netzgehirn.de",
